{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadows in the Silence</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game that includes disturbing scenes of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>N.B.</strong>\u00a0Since the demo is not fully optimized yet, <strong>it is recommended not to set shadow quality to &quot;Low&quot;</strong>, as it <strong>will negatively impact the gameplay experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the dark investigation of Liam Foreman, a journalist trapped in a mansion. Explore disturbing environments and discover the horrors of a sect devoted to Astaroth. Hallucinations and ambient noises aim for maximum player involvement. Where will Liam's investigation lead? Will he be able to stop the evil unleashed by this sect or will he too be another victim?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819210/extras/5736c01394d7b14e5e416f9f4837a5d0.poster.avif?t=1751490359\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819210/extras/5736c01394d7b14e5e416f9f4837a5d0.webm?t=1751490359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819210/extras/5736c01394d7b14e5e416f9f4837a5d0.mp4?t=1751490359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819210?t=1751490359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819210?t=1751490359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819210/a5b1c6d66a26628ba8ca6e54804c4dba604dc49c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751490359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse